  length validations
    validates name presence
    validates name length
    validates domain length
  usage_limits
    returns ChatwootApp.max limits
  #api_and_webhooks_enabled?
    is enabled for self-hosted accounts regardless of the stored feature flag
  captain defaults for new accounts
    does not store Captain model overrides or enable premium Captain features
  conversation unread counts feature flag
    clears unread count cache when the feature is enabled
    clears unread count cache when the feature is disabled
  resuming delayed automations
    reschedules the overdue backlog in the same transaction that re-enables the flag
    leaves the backlog alone when the flag is turned off
  feature flag columns
    configures the account feature flag extension column
    keeps existing feature flags on the original column
    keeps bulk selected feature assignment compatible with existing feature names
  inbound_email_domain
    returns the domain from inbox if inbox value is present
    returns the domain from ENV if inbox value is nil
    returns the domain from ENV if inbox value is empty string
  support_email
    returns the support email from inbox if inbox value is present
    returns the support email from ENV if inbox value is nil
    returns the support email from ENV if inbox value is empty string
  when after_destroy is called
    conv_dpid_seq and camp_dpid_seq_ are deleted
  locale
    returns correct language if the value is set
    returns english if the value is not set
    returns english if the value is empty string
    returns correct language if the value has country code
  settings
    when auto_resolve_after
      validates minimum value
      validates maximum value
      allows valid values
      allows null values
    when auto_resolve_message
      allows string values
      allows empty string
      allows nil values
    when using store_accessor
      correctly gets and sets auto_resolve_after
      correctly gets and sets auto_resolve_message
      defaults captain_auto_resolve_mode to legacy when captain_tasks is disabled
      defaults captain_auto_resolve_mode to evaluated when captain_tasks is enabled
