      finds accounts with auto_resolve_after set
      does not find accounts without auto_resolve_after
    when support_email is set
      allows a plain email address
      allows display-name format
      allows blank values
      rejects malformed strings with no email part
    when reporting_timezone is set
      allows valid timezone names
      rejects invalid timezone names
  captain_preferences
    with no saved preferences
      returns defaults from llm.yml
      returns GPT-5.2 for assistant when Captain V2 is enabled
    with saved model preferences
      returns saved preferences merged with defaults
    with saved feature preferences
      returns saved feature states
